Live TV Hub — API & Playlist Sources
Website: Live TV Hub
URL: https://livetvhub.rf.gd/

Note: These are public/free IPTV data sources and playlists used for loading channels and stream sources. They are not guaranteed to keep every channel online because public streams can be offline, region-limited, or changed by the source owner.

============================================================
MAIN API SOURCE
============================================================

Provider: iptv-org API
Purpose: Main structured channel database, stream list, country list, and logo list.
Base API:
https://iptv-org.github.io/api

API Endpoints:
https://iptv-org.github.io/api/channels.json
https://iptv-org.github.io/api/streams.json
https://iptv-org.github.io/api/countries.json
https://iptv-org.github.io/api/logos.json

