============================================================
RECOMMENDED USE
============================================================

Use iptv-org API as the main source.
Use iptv-org main playlist as the first playlist fallback.
Use category playlists for section-based loading.
Use country playlists for country filter loading.
Use Free-TV/IPTV as an extra fallback source.

Best order:
1. iptv-org API
2. iptv-org main playlist
3. iptv-org category playlists
4. iptv-org country playlists
5. Free-TV/IPTV playlist

